295	## `ChatEvent` / `ChatState` (`lib/features/chat/presentation/bloc/`) — NEW
296	
297	| Event | When |
298	|---|---|
299	| `ChatStarted` | Dispatched once by `app_router.dart`'s `/home` route builder, right after `ChatBloc` is constructed — resumes `lastActiveSessionId`, or shows the empty state if none exists. |
300	| `ConversationSelected(String sessionId)` | Tapping a past conversation in the side menu (dispatched by `AppDrawer` to the shared `ChatBloc`, research.md R7). |
301	| `NewConversationRequested` | Tapping "Novo Chat" (same dispatch path). Drops `sessionId`/`messages`, shows the empty, ready-to-send state — no repository call (FR-010's "MUST NOT by itself create a session"). |
302	| `MessageSubmitted(String text)` | The composer's send tap. |
303	| `MessageRetryRequested(String userMessageId)` | Tapping a `failed` message bubble. |
304	| `_ConnectivityChanged(bool isOnline)` *(internal)* | Fired by the `ConnectivityChecker.onConnectivityChanged` subscription `ChatBloc` opens in its constructor (research.md R8). |
305	
306	```dart
307	sealed class ChatState extends Equatable { const ChatState(); }
308	
309	class ChatLoading extends ChatState { const ChatLoading(); }   // only while resuming lastActiveSessionId on ChatStarted
310	
311	/// Everything else — an existing conversation, the empty "Novo Chat" state, or an outright
312	/// load failure with nothing cached to fall back to, are all one state shape so the screen
313	/// never has to discard/rebuild its `Scaffold`/`AppBar` switching between them.
314	class ChatReady extends ChatState {
315	  const ChatReady({
316	    required this.sessionId,            // null = empty conversation, no session created yet (FR-010)
317	    required this.messages,             // [] for an empty conversation
318	    required this.isOffline,
319	    required this.awaitingResponse,     // research.md R9 — gates the composer, true during a send/retry turn
320	    this.loadFailure,                   // set only when selecting an existing session's history failed outright
321	                                         // AND nothing is cached for it (Clarification 3's no-content edge case)
322	  });
323	
324	  final String? sessionId;
325	  final List<ChatMessage> messages;
326	  final bool isOffline;
327	  final bool awaitingResponse;
328	  final Failure? loadFailure;
329	
330	  bool get canSend => !isOffline && !awaitingResponse && loadFailure == null;
331	
332	  @override
333	  List<Object?> get props => [sessionId, messages, isOffline, awaitingResponse, loadFailure];
334	}
335	```
336	
337	`Stream<void> get reauthRequired` on `ChatBloc` — same one-shot-side-effect shape as `RecordsBloc`'s own
338	(research.md R3/R7; consumed by `HomeChatShellPage`, not `ChatBloc` itself).
339	
340	See `contracts/chat-bloc.md` for the full handler-by-handler sequencing (lazy session creation, the
341	optimistic-placeholder append, `emit.forEach` over the SSE stream, retry's position-matching).
