1	# Contract: `ChatBloc` (`lib/features/chat/presentation/bloc/chat_bloc.dart`)
2	
3	```dart
4	class ChatBloc extends Bloc<ChatEvent, ChatState> {
5	  ChatBloc({required ChatRepository chatRepository, required ConnectivityChecker connectivityChecker})
6	      : _chatRepository = chatRepository, // ignore: prefer_initializing_formals
7	        _connectivityChecker = connectivityChecker, // ignore: prefer_initializing_formals
8	        super(const ChatLoading()) {
9	    on<ChatStarted>(_onStarted);
10	    on<ConversationSelected>(_onConversationSelected);
11	    on<NewConversationRequested>(_onNewConversationRequested);
12	    on<MessageSubmitted>(_onMessageSubmitted);
13	    on<MessageRetryRequested>(_onMessageRetryRequested);
14	    on<_ConnectivityChanged>(_onConnectivityChanged);
15	    _connectivitySubscription = connectivityChecker.onConnectivityChanged.listen(
16	      (isOnline) => add(_ConnectivityChanged(isOnline)),
17	    );
18	  }
19	
20	  final ChatRepository _chatRepository;
21	  final ConnectivityChecker _connectivityChecker;
22	  late final StreamSubscription<bool> _connectivitySubscription;
23	  final _reauthController = StreamController<void>.broadcast();
24	  int _turnGeneration = 0;   // guards against a resolved/superseded turn's late emit (defensive; see research.md R9)
25	
26	  Stream<void> get reauthRequired => _reauthController.stream;
27	}
28	```
29	
30	## `ChatStarted` — resume last session or show empty state
31	
32	```dart
33	Future<void> _onStarted(ChatStarted event, Emitter<ChatState> emit) async {
34	  final isOnline = await _connectivityChecker.hasConnection();
35	  final lastId = await _chatRepository.lastActiveSessionId;
36	  if (lastId == null) {
37	    emit(ChatReady(sessionId: null, messages: const [], isOffline: !isOnline, awaitingResponse: false));
38	    return;
39	  }
40	  await _loadSession(lastId, emit, isOffline: !isOnline);
41	}
42	```
43	
44	## `ConversationSelected` / `NewConversationRequested`
45	
46	```dart
47	Future<void> _onConversationSelected(ConversationSelected event, Emitter<ChatState> emit) async {
48	  _turnGeneration++;   // invalidate any in-flight turn from the conversation being left (spec.md Edge Cases)
49	  final isOnline = await _connectivityChecker.hasConnection();
50	  await _loadSession(event.sessionId, emit, isOffline: !isOnline);
51	}
52	
53	Future<void> _onNewConversationRequested(NewConversationRequested event, Emitter<ChatState> emit) async {
54	  _turnGeneration++;   // same rationale as above
55	  final current = state;
56	  final isOffline = current is ChatReady ? current.isOffline : false;
57	  await _chatRepository.setLastActiveSessionId(null);
58	  emit(ChatReady(sessionId: null, messages: const [], isOffline: isOffline, awaitingResponse: false));
59	}
60	```
61	
62	Bumping `_turnGeneration` here (not just in `_onMessageSubmitted`/`_onMessageRetryRequested`) ensures `_consumeTurn`'s
63	`generation != _turnGeneration` guard also catches the case where the user navigates away from a conversation
64	mid-stream (spec.md Edge Cases: "the message reflects whatever the backend ultimately recorded... rather than
65	being stuck in a stale in-progress state") — without this, an abandoned turn's later `TokenReceived`/`StreamDone`/
66	`Left` items could still pass the guard and mutate whichever conversation's `ChatReady` state is current.
67	
68	## `_loadSession` — the shared fetch-with-cache-fallback path (Clarification 3)
69	
70	```dart
71	Future<void> _loadSession(String sessionId, Emitter<ChatState> emit, {required bool isOffline}) async {
72	  final result = await _chatRepository.listMessages(sessionId);
73	  result.match(
74	    (failure) {
75	      if (failure is AuthExpiredFailure) _reauthController.add(null);
76	      final cached = _chatRepository.cachedMessages(sessionId);
77	      if (cached == null) {
78	        // Never opened while online — "the standard no-connection state instead of any content"
79	        // (Edge Cases) — only reachable here, never for the empty/no-session state above.
80	        emit(ChatReady(
81	          sessionId: sessionId, messages: const [], isOffline: isOffline,
82	          awaitingResponse: false, loadFailure: failure,
83	        ));
84	      } else {
85	        emit(ChatReady(sessionId: sessionId, messages: cached, isOffline: isOffline, awaitingResponse: false));
86	      }
87	    },
88	    (messages) async {
89	      await _chatRepository.setLastActiveSessionId(sessionId);
90	      emit(ChatReady(sessionId: sessionId, messages: messages, isOffline: isOffline, awaitingResponse: false));
91	    },
92	  );
93	}
94	```
