3	Directly mirrors `RecordsBloc`'s own first-page/next-page/retry shape (RF07), narrowed to one call
4	(`ChatRepository.listSessions`) with no search/filter axis. Depends only on `ChatRepository` — never
5	`ChatBloc`, `SessionBloc`, or `ConnectivityChecker` (research.md R7).
