26	## `SessionsStarted` / `SessionsRefreshRequested` — both load page 1 (research.md R7)
27	
28	```dart
29	Future<void> _onStarted(SessionsStarted event, Emitter<ChatSessionsState> emit) async {
30	  emit(const ChatSessionsLoading());
31	  await _loadFirstPage(emit);
32	}
33	
34	Future<void> _onRefreshRequested(SessionsRefreshRequested event, Emitter<ChatSessionsState> emit) async {
35	  // Unlike _onStarted, never regresses a populated ChatSessionsLoaded back to ChatSessionsLoading —
36	  // the drawer's existing list stays visible while a fresh page 1 loads underneath it.
37	  await _loadFirstPage(emit);
38	}
39	
40	Future<void> _loadFirstPage(Emitter<ChatSessionsState> emit) async {
41	  final generation = ++_fetchGeneration;
42	  final result = await _chatRepository.listSessions();
43	  if (generation != _fetchGeneration) return;
44	
45	  result.match(
46	    (failure) {
47	      final cached = _chatRepository.cachedSessions;
48	      if (failure is AuthExpiredFailure) _reauthController.add(null);
49	      if (cached.isEmpty) {
50	        emit(ChatSessionsLoadFailure(failure));
51	      } else {
52	        emit(ChatSessionsLoaded(sessions: cached, nextCursor: null, isLoadingMore: false));
53	      }
54	    },
55	    (page) => emit(ChatSessionsLoaded(sessions: page.sessions, nextCursor: page.nextCursor, isLoadingMore: false)),
56	  );
57	}
58	```
