227	| # | Scenario | Expected |
228	|---|---|---|
229	| 1 | `createSession` with title "Como lidar com ansiedade antes de apresentações" | `chat-sessions-create` called with `{"title": "..."}` verbatim; parsed `ChatSession` upserted into `cachedSessions` |
230	| 2 | `listSessions()` → `AuthExpiredFailure` on first call, success on the retry | exactly one `SessionRepository.refresh()` call, then one more `listSessions` call; final result is `Right` |
